On Medusa, the key trick is not to engage in hand-to-hand combat with
the sea monsters, unless you're wearing an oilskin cloak or an amulet of
magical breathing. They'll pull you under and kill you otherwise. Boots
of water walking or levitation are *not* enough: they make you float,
but the force of the monsters to pull you under is stronger.

